WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Balance the quantities without replacing the substances.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Two water molecules fix oxygen—but change the hydrogen total.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.500
Your turn: how many hydrogen molecules supply four H atoms?

4
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:24.000
Two H₂ molecules. Now every element matches on both sides.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Change coefficients, not the specified chemical formulas.
